  "text.pomkotsmechs.gui.opening.00": "──In the distant future… on a strangely familiar world──",
  "text.pomkotsmechs.gui.opening.01.1": "Humanity once reached for the edge of space,",
  "text.pomkotsmechs.gui.opening.01.2": "building an age of stars through endless ambition and relentless innovation.",
  "text.pomkotsmechs.gui.opening.02": "Yet no matter how far civilization advanced, conflict never faded.",
  "text.pomkotsmechs.gui.opening.03": "Those who should have understood one another wounded each other more deeply,",
  "text.pomkotsmechs.gui.opening.04": "and then… the end came.",
  "text.pomkotsmechs.gui.opening.05": "Nations fell, corporations collapsed, and the earth was scorched.",
  "text.pomkotsmechs.gui.opening.06": "A long time passed. Civilization vanished, and nature reclaimed the ruins.",
  "text.pomkotsmechs.gui.opening.07": "The unmanned weapons left behind still operate, hunting humanity as “the enemy.”",
  "text.pomkotsmechs.gui.opening.08": "Even in fear of that threat, people endured and survived.",
  "text.pomkotsmechs.gui.opening.09": "And today, a young soul comes of age in a shelter.",
